{
  "title": "Smart Hospital - Service SLI / SLO / SLA (dev)",
  "description": "SLIs from APM (ddtrace FastAPI spans; /health probes excluded), SLO status and error budget for the six services, and the SLA reference. Targets: availability SLO ${availability_target}% / 30d, latency SLO p95 <= ${latency_threshold_ms} ms in ${latency_target}% of 5-minute slices, SLA ${sla_target}%. Managed by Terraform (infra/terraform/environments/dev-observability).",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "default": "dev"
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "title": "Definitions",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "**SLI** availability = (requests - 5xx errors) / requests, from APM.  **SLI** latency = p95 request duration.\n\n**SLO** availability ${availability_target}% over 30 days; latency p95 <= ${latency_threshold_ms} ms in ${latency_target}% of 5-minute windows.\n\n**SLA** ${sla_target}% availability (customer commitment, below the SLO so the SLO alerts first). Colours on the SLI tiles: green >= SLO, yellow between SLA and SLO, red < SLA.",
              "background_color": "gray",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "show_tick": false,
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "title": "SLI - availability (selected time range)",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "identity-service availability SLI",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "h",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.hits{env:$env,service:identity-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "e",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.errors{env:$env,service:identity-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "(h - e) / h * 100",
                      "number_format": {
                        "unit": {
                          "type": "canonical_unit",
                          "unit_name": "percent"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 2,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "patient-service availability SLI",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "h",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.hits{env:$env,service:patient-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "e",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.errors{env:$env,service:patient-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "(h - e) / h * 100",
                      "number_format": {
                        "unit": {
                          "type": "canonical_unit",
                          "unit_name": "percent"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 2,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 2,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "provider-service availability SLI",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "h",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.hits{env:$env,service:provider-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "e",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastapi.request.errors{env:$env,service:provider-service}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "(h - e) / h * 100",
                      "number_format": {
                        "unit": {
                          "type": "canonical_unit",
                          "unit_name": "percent"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 99.5,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 4,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 2,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "facility-service availability SLI",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 2,
              "requests": [
                {
